ivo AELU's manager, Juan Carlos García, praised Pierre's signing, saying, \"Frédéric is a world-class player who will undoubtedly elevate our team's performance."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1292, "end": 1360, "text": "His creativity and work rate will be a valuable asset to our squad.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1361, "end": 1486, "text": "The Belgian midfielder is expected to make his debut for Deportivo AELU in the upcoming match against CD Leganés on March 20."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1487, "end": 1588, "text": "Fans are eagerly anticipating his arrival, with ticket sales for the match already surpassing 20,000."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1589, "end": 1825, "text": "Data from the Spanish Football Federation shows that Deportivo AELU has seen a significant increase in attendance and revenue since the start of the season, with the club's average attendance rising by 15% and revenue increasing by 20%."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1826, "end": 1925, "text": "The signing of Pierre is expected to further boost the club's popularity and financial performance."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1926, "end": 2101, "text": "When asked about his expectations for the season, Pierre said, \"I'm focused on helping the team achieve its goals and making a strong push for a top-five finish in the league."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2102, "end": 2191, "text": "With the talent and dedication of my new teammates, I'm confident we can make it happen.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2192, "end": 2366, "text": "As Pierre settles into his new role, fans and pundits alike will be watching closely to see how he adapts to his new surroundings and contributes to Deportivo AELU's success."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Journey of Frédéric Pierre: A Tale of Passion and Perseverance"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 84, "end": 272, "text": "In the world of association football, where talent and dedication are the currencies of success, one player's journey stands out as a testament to the power of hard work and determination."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 273, "end": 417, "text": "Meet Frédéric Pierre, a Belgian footballer who has made a name for himself in the French football league, donning the colors of Nîmes Olympique."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 418, "end": 489, "text": "Growing up in Belgium, Frédéric was always drawn to the beautiful game."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 490, "end": 655, "text": "As a young boy, he would spend hours kicking the ball around with his friends in the streets of his hometown, dreaming of one day becoming a professional footballer."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 656, "end": 772, "text": "His parents, though skeptical at first, soon recognized their son's passion and encouraged him to pursue his dreams."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 773, "end": 921, "text": "Frédéric's big break came when he was scouted by a local Belgian club, where he honed his skills and developed a reputation as a skilled midfielder."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 922, "end": 1036, "text": "However, it wasn't until he made the bold decision to cross the border into France that his career truly took off."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1037, "end": 1130, "text": "In 2018, Frédéric signed with Nîmes Olympique, a club with a rich history in French football."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1131, "end": 1229, "text": "Founded in 1937, Nîmes Olympique has a loyal fan base and a commitment to developing young talent."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1230, "end": 1303, "text": "For Frédéric, the opportunity to play for the club was a dream come true."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1304, "end": 1398, "text": "As he settled into his new surroundings, Frédéric quickly became an integral part of the team."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1399, "end": 1523, "text": "His vision on the pitch, combined with his tireless work ethic, made him a favorite among the coaching staff and fans alike."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1524, "end": 1609, "text": "In his debut season, he made 25 appearances, scoring 3 goals and providing 5 assists."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1610, "end": 1677, "text": "But Frédéric's success wasn't limited to his on-field performances."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1678, "end": 1791, "text": "He also became an ambassador for the club, engaging with the local community and participating in charity events."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1792, "end": 1914, "text": "His dedication to the team and its fans earned him the respect and admiration of everyone associated with Nîmes Olympique."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1915, "end": 2092, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Frédéric's affiliation with Nîmes Olympique is his inclusion in the team's official squad list for the 2019-2020 season."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2093, "end": 2220, "text": "According to the club's website, Frédéric is listed as a midfielder, with his name and photo appearing alongside his teammates."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Deportivo AELU", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Nîmes Olympique", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"