éric's success wasn't limited to his on-field performances. He also became an ambassador for the club, engaging with the local community and participating in charity events. His dedication to the team and its fans earned him the respect and admiration of everyone associated with Nîmes Olympique. One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Frédéric's affiliation with Nîmes Olympique is his inclusion in the team's official squad list for the 2019-2020 season.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Deportivo AELU", "Nîmes Olympique"]}

